  "reference": "2 Amakuru 30",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "30",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia atumaho Isiraeli yona na Yuda, Efraimu na Manase nabo abahandikira ebarua kabaija Yerusalemu omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama, kushemeleza Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli Pasika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Hezekia n'abatwazibe n'enteko yona, omuli Yerusalemu bakaba bategekire kulya Pasika omu mwezi gwa kabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okutagiliira mu bukiro bwayo orubara rw'abakuhani ababaire bayeshemeize rukaba rutalikumara, kandi n'abantu bakaba batahurwire bangi kwija Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo entegeka egyo ekashemelera Omukama Hezekia n'enteko yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baragira kutaho omurango omuli Isiraeli yona, kwema Berisheba kugoba Dani, okwo abantu bona baragiirwe kwija Yerusalemu kushemeleza Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli Pasika, kuba bakaba batakagishemezaga bali bangi nk'okwo babaire nibaragirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatarishi bagenda n'ebarua z'omukama n'ez'abatwazi, baraba omuli Isiraeli yona na Yuda, nk'okwo Hezekia yabaire aragiire ati, “Inywe Baisiraeli, mugaruke aha Mukama Ruhanga wa Aburahamu, Isaka na Isiraeli, nawe ashube aije abahabukire inywe nsigalira abahonokire aha bakama ba Asiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleke kurondora baisheinywe na barumuna banyu abagokeire Omukama Ruhanga wa baishebo. Na inywe nimubona okwo yabahaire ekibonabonyio ky'amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleke kugumangana emitima nka baisheinywe. Mwenage omu mikono y'Omukama mwije Ahatakatifu omwa wenene mbali yahindwire hatakatifu eirai lyona, mukolere Omukama Ruhanga wanyu, alekere kubanigalira muno, abaganyire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba kamuramugarukaho, abatwete barumuna banyu n'abaana banyu endore barabagilira ekisha bagaruke omu nsi egi. Nobona Omukama Ruhanga wanyu aina ekisha n'obuganyizi; kamuramugarukaho arabakunda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatarishi bagoba buli kigo omu nsi ya Efraimu na Manase, bagoba Zebuluni, kyonkai abantu babashekelera babajamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bake omuli Asheri, Manase na Zebuluni abayetohize bakaija Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga nawe ayemamu Yuda batambuka ntambuka emoi, bakora ebyo yaragiire Omukama Hezekia n'abatwazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwezi gwa kabili abantu embaga mpango muno bateranira Yerusalemu kushemeza Ekiro ky'Emikate etatumbisiibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakora omulimo, bakwata ealutare ezabaire zili Yerusalemu, na ealutare zona ez'okwoteraho obunuma bazitwara bazinaga omu Ruhanga rwa Kidironi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya ikumi na binai ky'omwezi gwa kabili baita akataama ka Pasika. Abakuhani n'Abalevita enshoni zibaita, aho babona beshemeze, nikwo kuleta n'ebihongo by'okwokibwa omuli Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagya omu miruka yabo nk'okwo Amateka ga Musa omwiru wa Ruhanga gabaragiraga. Abalevita baheleza abakuhani obwamba babushaimulira ealutare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu nteko hakaba halimu abantu bangi ababaire batakeshemeize. Aho Abalevita baitira buli omoi omuli abo akataama ka Pasika kukahongera Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bangi muno ababaire barugire Efraimu na Manase, Isakari na Zebuluni bakaba bakyahagaire, kyonkai baburwa kweshemeza nk'okwo babaire nibaragirwa, aho balya Pasika. Okugira batyo Omukama Hezekia hakaba abashabiire nagamba ati, “Omukama nyamurungi asinge agarurlire buli omoi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aramutaho omwoyo, Omukama Ruhanga wa baishenkuru, n'orwo baraba batahondeire Mateka ga bwera ag'Ahatakatifu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama asinga ahulira Hezekia, abantu abakiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli ababaire bali Yerusalemu bakora Obugenyi bw'Omukate Ogutatumbisiibwe n'ebyera bingi muno ebiro mushanju. Abalevita n'abakuhani basingiza Omukama, bamuhoyera n'amani gabo gona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalevita abakoleire Omukama n'akatebwe Hezekia abatamu ekihika. Abantu balya ekyakulya ky'obugenyi ebiro mushanju, nibatamba ebihongo by'emilembe, nibasiima Omukama Ruhanga wa baishebo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enteko yona eshuba eikilijanyia kugendelera n'obugenyi obwo ebiro ebindi mushanju, mara babukora n'amashemelerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Hezekia owa Yuda akaha enteko ente 1,000 n'entaama 7,000 z'okuhonga, kandi abatwazi nabo enteko bagiha ente 1,000 n'entaama 10,000; kandi abakuhani batali bake bayeshemeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enteko yona ya Yuda, abakuhani n'Abalevita, n'enteko yona eyabaire erugire Isiraeli n'abafuruki bamwo, n'abafuruki abaturaga Yuda bashanduka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amashemelerwa gaba gangi omuli Yerusalemu, kuba kwema omu makiro ga Solomoni mutabani w'Omukama Daudi owa Isiraeli, ekyab'eki kikaba kitakabagaho omuli Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma abakuhani n'Abalevita baimuka baha abantu omugisha, eiraka lyabo lihulirwa, n'enshara yabo egoba omu businge bw'Omukama omw'iguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
